      "content": "i don't know... it just feels so selfish to stay when i know i'm just dragging them into my misery. sometimes i think the most loving thing i could actually do is just stop being a problem for them. like, if i weren't around, the struggle would just... disappear for them. they wouldn't have to watch me fail every day.",
